SUMMARY:Supreme Court: The "logical discrepancy" list
DESCRIPTION:The Court said names in the "logical discrepancy" category\, fl
 agged because something in their link to the old roll did not match\, may 
 be displayed at panchayat\, block and ward offices. Documents could be fil
 ed through an authorised representative such as a booth agent\, the Commis
 sion was to allow ten more days from the display\, and the Madhyamik admit
  card may be accepted. Source: https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2025/64
 235/64235_2025_1_30_67603_Order_19-Jan-2026.pdf More: https://offtheroll.i
 n/india/process/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
END:VEVENT
