UID:sc-2026-02-09@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261026T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260209
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260210
SUMMARY:Supreme Court: More officers to help
DESCRIPTION:The Court had 8\,505 state officers report to the district and 
 registration officers to assist them\, with the final decision left to the
  registration officers. Scrutiny was given at least a week beyond 14 Febru
 ary. Source: https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2025/64235/64235_2025_1_4
 0_68501_Order_09-Feb-2026.pdf More: https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
END:VEVENT
