DTSTAMP:20261026T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260310
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260311
SUMMARY:Supreme Court: Appeals go to tribunals
DESCRIPTION:No executive officer could hear an appeal against an order of t
 he judicial officers. Appeals were to go to tribunals of former Chief Just
 ices and judges\, which the Commission would notify in consultation with t
 he Chief Justice of the Calcutta High Court. Source: https://api.sci.gov.i
 n/supremecourt/2025/64235/64235_2025_1_42_69352_Order_10-Mar-2026.pdf More
 : https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/process/
END:VEVENT
