UID:ev-23@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261026T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261013
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:BJP district rallies backing the SIR (statewide mass awareness camp
 aign)
DESCRIPTION:A series of BJP rallies at district headquarters in Assam backi
 ng the Prime Minister and the SIR of electoral rolls. In Guwahati the stat
 e party chief Dilip Saikia led a 'Jana Jagaran Samadal' rally from Khanapa
 ra. Organised by Bharatiya Janata Party\, Assam unit (a political party). 
 Place: District headquarters across Assam. Rallies were reported in Nalbar
 i on 13 October\, Guwahati and Jorhat on 14 October\, and Silchar. Source:
  https://assamtribune.com/assam/assam-bjp-rallies-across-districts-to-defe
 nd-sir-counter-opposition-protests-1620261
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/events/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ev-26@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261026T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261022
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261106
SUMMARY:'Save democracy\, end mob rule' campaign
DESCRIPTION:A 15-day BJP campaign in Haryana of press conferences\, foot ma
 rches\, district public meetings and constituency discussions presenting t
 he party's case on the Election Commission and the SIR. Organised by Bhara
 tiya Janata Party\, Haryana unit (Chief Minister Nayab Singh Saini and sta
 te president Archana Gupta) (a political party). Place: Across Haryana. Pu
 blic meetings at district level and foot marches in assembly constituencie
 s. Source: https://www.hindustantimes.com/cities/chandigarh-news/haryana-b
 jp-to-launch-save-democracy-end-mob-rule-campaign-from-october-22-10179243
 9542664.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/events/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ev-37@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261026T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
SUMMARY:'Loktantra bachao\, bheedtantra hatao' campaign in Dakshina Kannada
DESCRIPTION:A BJP campaign in Dakshina Kannada\, part of the party's nation
 al campaign\, which the district president said is aimed at public awarene
 ss of the revision\, the accuracy of the voter lists and constitutional pr
 ocesses. The padayatras are to end by 5 November and the sessions with you
 th and intellectuals run to 30 November. Organised by Bharatiya Janata Par
 ty\, Dakshina Kannada unit (district president Satish Kumpala\, committee 
 led by Kishore Kumar Puttur\, MLC) (a political party). Place: Across Daks
 hina Kannada. Padayatras at district and Assembly constituency level\, and
  sessions with youth and intellectuals. Source: https://www.thehindu.com/n
 ews/cities/Mangalore/bjp-to-launch-campaign-in-dakshina-kannada-to-counter
 -misinformation-over-sir/article71619925.ece
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/events/
END:VEVENT
