DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
SUMMARY:INDIA bloc march to the Chief Electoral Officer's office\, Agartala
DESCRIPTION:The INDIA bloc in Tripura announced a march against the revisio
 n ending with a memorandum at the Chief Electoral Officer's office. It dem
 ands that the revision be cancelled\, that the Chief Election Commissioner
  be taken out of office and that the legal provisions on the Commission's 
 independence be reviewed\, and it opposes the provisions that give the Chi
 ef Election Commissioner legal protection. Organised by INDIA bloc\, Tripu
 ra (CPI(M) state secretary Jitendra Chaudhury and Tripura Pradesh Congress
  president Ashish Kumar Saha) (a political party). Place: From Orient Chow
 muhani to the office of the Chief Electoral Officer\, Tripura\, Agartala. 
 Source: https://sanmarg.in/amp/story/%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A4/
 %E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%81%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BE-%
 E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%82-%E0%A4%8F%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%88%E0%A4%86%E
 0%A4%B0-%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%87-%E0%A4%96%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%AB-3
 0-%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8B-%E0%A4%B5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B
 7%E0%A5%80-%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B6
 %E0%A4%A8
