UID:ev-43@offtheroll.in
DTSTAMP:20261026T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
SUMMARY:INDIA bloc 'public impeachment' of the Chief Election Commissioner
DESCRIPTION:A mock Parliament of INDIA bloc MPs and leaders\, at which Venu
 gopal said the public's verdict to remove Chief Election Commissioner Gyan
 esh Kumar would be delivered. It has no legal effect\, since a Chief Elect
 ion Commissioner can be removed only by Parliament in the manner of a Supr
 eme Court judge. Venugopal said the Dilli Chalo March to Ramlila Maidan wo
 uld follow on 1 November. Organised by INDIA bloc (announced by Congress g
 eneral secretary K. C. Venugopal) (a political party). Place: Hotel Ashok\
 , New Delhi\, as PTI reported it had learnt. Source: https://www.business-
 standard.com/india-news/india-bloc-to-hold-public-impeachment-of-cec-gyane
 sh-kumar-on-oct-30-126102401134_1.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/events/
END:VEVENT
