SUMMARY:INDIA bloc rally at Ramlila Maidan
DESCRIPTION:A one-day rally in Delhi organised by the Congress as part of t
 he INDIA bloc's campaign against the SIR. Delhi Police issued a no-objecti
 on certificate. Congress general secretary K. C. Venugopal said on 24 Octo
 ber that a 'Dilli Chalo March' would end at Ramlila Maidan on 1 November\,
  and Mahila Congress chief Alka Lamba said the rally would not be postpone
 d or cancelled. Organised by Indian National Congress\, hosting INDIA bloc
  parties\, with student bodies and civil society organisations (a politica
 l party). Place: Ramlila Maidan\, New Delhi. Source: https://www.indiatoda
 y.in/india/story/delhi-police-issues-noc-congress-rally-ramlila-maidan-nov
 ember-1-india-bloc-sir-protest-gyanesh-kumar-rahul-gandhi-3019706-2026-10-
 17
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://offtheroll.in/india/events/
