SUMMARY:BJP padayatra in Hyderabad ('Loktantra Bachao\, Arajakta Hatao')
DESCRIPTION:A BJP foot march in Hyderabad which the state party president s
 aid is to answer what he called the Congress's false narrative on the revi
 sion. He said Union Home Minister Amit Shah would take part. Organised by 
 Bharatiya Janata Party\, Telangana unit (state president N. Ramchander Rao
 ) (a political party). Place: Hyderabad (route not stated). Source: https:
 //www.siasat.com/amit-shah-to-participate-in-telangana-bjps-nov-2-padayatr
 a-3564742/
