SUMMARY:INDIA bloc protest against SIR in Bengaluru
DESCRIPTION:A protest in Bengaluru announced by INDIA bloc parties in Karna
 taka\, demanding the scrapping of the SIR and restoration of eligible vote
 rs' names. The parties said district and taluk demonstrations would follow
 . Organised by INDIA bloc Karnataka unit (KPCC president B.K. Hariprasad)\
 , with Congress\, CPI\, CPI(M)\, CPI(ML) Liberation\, Samajwadi Party and 
 Forward Bloc (a political party). Place: Bengaluru (venue not stated). Sou
 rce: https://www.thehansindia.com/news/cities/bengaluru/massive-protest-ag
 ainst-sir-planned-on-november-5-1133177
