SUMMARY:BJP padayatra in Karnal with Amit Shah
DESCRIPTION:A BJP foot march in Karnal that Union Home Minister Amit Shah i
 s to join\, with Chief Minister Nayab Singh Saini and Union Minister Manoh
 ar Lal expected. The state president said Shah would arrive at 10 am. It f
 alls on the last day of the Haryana campaign in ev-26. Organised by Bharat
 iya Janata Party\, Haryana unit (state president Archana Gupta) (a politic
 al party). Place: Karnal (the proposed venue the state president visited i
 s in Sector 12). Source: https://www.oneindia.com/india/loktantra-bachao-a
 rajakta-hatao-bjp-announces-hyderabad-padyatra-with-amit-shah-8243235.html
